## Stack

- **Backend:** PHP 8.4+{% if choices.docker != "none" %} (PHP 8.5 in the Docker images){% endif %} and Laravel 13: routing, form request validation, Eloquent models, migrations, sessions and cache in the database.
- **Frontend:** Inertia 3 with {% if vue %}Vue 3.5 single-file components (`<script setup lang="ts">`){% else %}React 19 function components (TSX){% endif %}. Laravel controllers return pages with props; there is no separate JSON API and no client-side router. Links and forms go through Inertia (`Link`, `router`, `useForm`).
- **Styles:** {% if choices.css == "tailwind" %}Tailwind CSS 4 (`@tailwindcss/vite`). Utilities work in every template; the shared building blocks (`card`, `btn`, `form-control`, `alert`…) are component classes in `resources/css/app.css`.{% elif choices.css == "bootstrap" %}Bootstrap 5.3 (CSS only, imported in `resources/css/app.css`). Use Bootstrap's components and utilities; app-specific layout classes live in `resources/css/app.css`.{% else %}plain CSS in `resources/css/app.css`: design tokens as CSS variables, a few shared building blocks (`card`, `btn`, `form-control`, `alert`…), light and dark mode through `prefers-color-scheme`.{% endif %}
- **Database:** {% if choices.database == "sqlite" %}SQLite, a single file `data/database.sqlite`.{% elif choices.docker == "none" %}{{ dbname }} on a server you run yourself (see Configuration).{% else %}{{ dbname }} {% if choices.database == "postgres" %}18{% else %}8.4{% endif %} in the `db` container.{% endif %} Tests always use an in-memory SQLite database.
- **Build:** Vite 8 with `laravel-vite-plugin` (hot reload in development, hashed assets in `public/build` for production), TypeScript 6 in strict mode.
- **Quality:** PHPUnit 12 feature tests, Larastan (PHPStan at level max), Pint (Laravel preset), ESLint (typescript-eslint strict, type-checked{% if vue %}, eslint-plugin-vue{% else %}, React hooks rules{% endif %}), Prettier{% if choices.css == "tailwind" %} with the Tailwind class sorter{% endif %}.
{%- if choices.docker != "none" %}
- **Docker:** {% if full %}a `dev` container for everything in development and {% endif %}a production image served by FrankenPHP (see Docker below).
{%- endif %}

